title: BirdTeach
---
Hey! Your nest-building skills are terrible! What kind of bird are you, anyway? (Press E)

Not a bird? But everyone knows only birds exist under the yellow sky!

Have you heard of the Mysterious Fruit higher up in the tower? We’ve flown up countless times but have never seen it ourselves.

So you’re climbing the tower? Then please, go and find that fruit!

Let me teach you a bird’s skill you might need! We’ll inject the power of yellow into the MARBLE — so no wings needed to fly!

Now, get close to the marble and double-click to give it a try.

If you want to pull the power out, just doble-click again! (Press E)
===


title: BirdTeachYellow
---
YOU LEARNED TO FLY!!! I accept you as an honorary Spotted Dove ^^. (Press E)

Then try this, double-click it again to pull the power out.

Now go forth, reach higher—like a true bird! BYE! (Press E)
===




title: BirdTeachBlue
---
Oh, thanks for making me a cozy little nest! (Press E)

How did you know I was too cold and tired to go any further? 

I’m just flapping my way up this tower under the shiny yellow sky, but oopsie—ran into a little hiccup along the way! 

As a reward, let me show you how to use those mysterious marbles. They say that infusing it with the power from different periods creates different effects. 

I only know the yellow one creates Wind. Give it a double-click and see what happens!
===



title: BirdTeachGreenOrRed
---
Please don't learn ahead; I shouldn't be teaching you this right now.

Don’t forget how to use the marble, okay? Bye!
===



title: BirdForceGoUp
---
Is there anything floating?

===





title: TomatoIntroduction
---
Oh my, your skin is transparent! (Press E)

A mysterious fruit? What’s that? Well, I am a fruit… but who isn’t, here in the red world?

Every fruit dreams of falling, then moving, and spreading seeds far and wide. I wonder when I’ll finally get to fall… or maybe I’ve already fallen and just got too hurt to move.

Did you know? There’s a legend that all fruits once fell from a single, giant, strange plant higher up. I’d love to see it again.

But I can’t move. So, let me grant you the power of red. If you could take my power to that plant, it would mean so much. They say it has a magical conduit… I hope I could run through it someday.

Anyway, double click to inject my power to the marble. Wish you a safe journey!
===



