title: GreenDialogueEndGame
---
The energy of fruit... I can feel it coursing through me. My roots stir…(Press E)

What? I should teach you how to inject green into the marble? Oh, I suppose I should.

Too bad VV and Sherry have set the scope too big. They are tangled up in making this game juicy and bug-free — while I, naturally, effortlessly achieve both with every single fruit I grow.

Let’s end the game here. See the flame above you? Go touch it. (Press E)
===




